'''The Electric Tale of Pikachu issue 2''' is the second monthly issue of the manga series [[The Electric Tale of Pikachu]] to be released by [[VIZ Media]]. It contains the third chapter of the manga, ''[[ET03|Clefairy Tale]]''. 

The reason the third chapter was published as issue 2 and [[ET02|chapter two]] published as [[Electric Tale of Pikachu issue 3|issue 3]] is widely speculated to be due to the VIZ Media receiving negative feedback on the largely unedited amounts of cleavage from Misty and [[Daisy Oak|May Oak]] in [[Electric Tale of Pikachu issue 1|issue #1]], so extensive editing was done on chapter two to cover up {{an|Misty}} and her sisters' revealing swimsuits, requiring chapter three to be released first to keep the releases on schedule. This reordering creates a continuity error, as {{Ash}} uses {{AP|Butterfree}} in this chapter, which he actually captures as a Caterpie in issue #3/chapter two.

This issue was included as part of {{vol|Electric Tale of Pikachu|1}} along with [[ET01]], [[ET02]], and [[ET04]]. The original order of the chapters was restored for the collected volume release.

